# Snake

See [custom applications](/docs/applications/custom/). Advanced stress demo,
not a second walkthrough.

A multiplayer stress demo: lobby and board in `Snake.rocci`, ticks and
collisions in `Game.roc`, HTTP and SSE in `main.roc`. Keyboard and touch
steering live in `snake-input.js`. This is **docs-only** on the public origin
(not a live hostname).

Up to eight snakes share a 100×100 grid. The server ticks at about 8 Hz and
morphs `#board`, `#hud`, and `#minimap`.

See the [source tree](/examples/snake/source/).

## Run locally

```sh
cargo run -q -p rocci-cli -- run examples/rocci/custom/snake
```

If you already ran an older build, delete `examples/rocci/custom/snake/snake.db`
so the world schema can be created fresh.

## Smoke

```sh
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/ | grep -E 'Join game|Spectate'
```
